This example illustrates how to use LogManager. 
LogManager is a separate subproject and is self-sufficient and can be utilized 
in other projects: it runs in separate thread (not blocking main application), supports any
number of debug levels and 3 channels (stdout, stderr and events). One LogManager instance
per VM will be created automatically in user.dir if not explicitly created by one of the factories.
For explanations look into comments in the source.





